{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/extras/steam_gif_10.gif?t=1755039363\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u200e</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Night: The Darkness Within \u2014 Demo</strong> is a taste of the dark, psychological Metroidvania adventure where every step draws you deeper into Jake\u2019s fractured mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore a section of surreal dreamscapes, confront twisted inner demons, and uncover fragments of Jake\u2019s story in this early experience of the full game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your descent begins here \u2014 but the truth still waits below.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/extras/steam_gif_2.gif?t=1755039363\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Until you make the unconscious conscious, <strong>it will direct your life and you will call it fate.</strong>&quot;</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >                                                                                                            -Carl Gustav Jung</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/extras/steam_gif_0.gif?t=1755039363\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Hey there.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>I\u2019m Jake \u2014 and I\u2019m finally ready to face what\u2019s been hiding in the dark. In this demo, you\u2019ll join me for the beginning of my descent. Just a glimpse... but enough to feel the pull. Ready to step in?</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIMENTAL PLATFORMING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out the game\u2019s unique platforming system with fireflies that grant horizontal and vertical boosts, teleportation, and gravity-shifting mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/extras/fireflies_misc-optimize.gif?t=1755039363\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARLY COMBAT SHOWCASE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a handful of enemies and one tough boss fight \u2014 designed to give you a feel for the game\u2019s flowy, martial-arts-inspired combat. Your dream powers may just get you through... if you can master them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/extras/spiders-optimize.gif?t=1755039363\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GLIMPSE OF THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes a curated slice of the full game\u2019s haunting environments \u2014 beautiful, mysterious, and ready to twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/extras/vigil_walkthrough-optimize.gif?t=1755039363\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRY CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sample a few gear options to tweak Jake\u2019s abilities and style. You'll need them to survive what little this demo has to show\u2026 and what it hints at beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/extras/equipment-crop.gif?t=1755039363\" /></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3719960?t=1755039363","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/3afecb0f82c9a356e050870adc722c877d1bf8ea/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755039363","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/4a4daad2fd6578c6b9800b8bfa89265ba0a2e28d/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755039363","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/4a4daad2fd6578c6b9800b8bfa89265ba0a2e28d/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755039363","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Keyboard Only Option","id":75},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"Endless Night: The Darkness Within delves into intense psychological themes, exploring PTSD, childhood trauma, and the emotional struggles of its protagonist, Jake. The game features symbolic representations of inner conflict, including Burning Boy, a haunting manifestation of Jake\u2019s injured inner child and unresolved pain.\r\n\r\nThe game includes:\r\n\r\nPsychological Themes: Depictions of mental health struggles, trauma, and symbolic representations of fear and loss.\r\nDisturbing Imagery: Characters like Burning Boy, designed to evoke discomfort and reflection on Jake\u2019s fractured psyche.\r\nViolence: Intense combat with humanoid and creature-like enemies, featuring blood effects and graphic depictions of injury.\r\nDark and Emotional Storytelling: Themes of grief, fear, and redemption, portrayed through surreal and unsettling dreamscapes.\r\nThis content is designed for mature audiences capable of engaging with its complex and emotional narrative."},