ass=\"bb_tag\" >EXPERIMENTAL PLATFORMING</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Try out the game\u2019s unique platforming system with fireflies that grant horizontal and vertical boosts, teleportation, and gravity-shifting mechanics.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/extras/fireflies_misc-optimize.gif?t=1755039363\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >EARLY COMBAT SHOWCASE</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face off against a handful of enemies and one tough boss fight \u2014 designed to give you a feel for the game\u2019s flowy, martial-arts-inspired combat. Your dream powers may just get you through... if you can master them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/extras/spiders-optimize.gif?t=1755039363\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A GLIMPSE OF THE WORLD</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This demo includes a curated slice of the full game\u2019s haunting environments \u2014 beautiful, mysterious, and ready to twist.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/extras/vigil_walkthrough-optimize.gif?t=1755039363\" /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >TRY CHARACTER CUSTOMIZATION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sample a few gear options to tweak Jake\u2019s abilities and style. You'll need them to survive what little this demo has to show\u2026 and what it hints at beyond.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/extras/equipment-crop.gif?t=1755039363\" /></span></p>","developers":["Little Guy Games"],"fullgame":{