/ss_3c745a051886e2dc6e681c1b4248987e066a084d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755039363","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/3c745a051886e2dc6e681c1b4248987e066a084d/ss_3c745a051886e2dc6e681c1b4248987e066a084d.600x338.jpg?t=1755039363"},{"id":11,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/1c41cc687b3587e8f424651ae2e59163b30bd50b/ss_1c41cc687b3587e8f424651ae2e59163b30bd50b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755039363","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/1c41cc687b3587e8f424651ae2e59163b30bd50b/ss_1c41cc687b3587e8f424651ae2e59163b30bd50b.600x338.jpg?t=1755039363"},{"id":12,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/88bf3f489e319018a8b3f462d30c0b60dabc3303/ss_88bf3f489e319018a8b3f462d30c0b60dabc3303.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755039363","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/88bf3f489e319018a8b3f462d30c0b60dabc3303/ss_88bf3f489e319018a8b3f462d30c0b60dabc3303.600x338.jpg?t=1755039363"},{"id":13,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/f4d0581e8bd634bbc716f6957985a10e0b202e1d/ss_f4d0581e8bd634bbc716f6957985a10e0b202e1d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1755039363","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3719960/f4d0581e8bd634bbc716f6957985a10e0b202e1d/ss_f4d0581e8bd634bbc716f6957985a10e0b202e1d.600x338.jpg?t=1755039363"}],"short_description":"Step into Jake\u2019s mind in this free demo of Endless Night: The Darkness Within, a psychological Metroidvania. Explore a glimpse of surreal dreamworlds, try fluid platforming, and battle early shadows of his inner darkness.","steam_appid":3719960,"support_info":{"email":"support@littleguygames.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"demo","website":"https://litt